          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਚੁੱਲ੍ਹਾ (cullhā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from cullī, \"fireplace\" (CDIAL 4879). CDIAL takes the Sanskrit word itself from Dravidian."
            }
          ]
        },
